* ============================================================
* QM_SDL_Q - Development / Connectivity Testing Configuration
* Wide-open security for dev client testing
* ============================================================

* --- Disable Connection Authentication & Channel Authentication ---
ALTER QMGR CHLAUTH(DISABLED) CONNAUTH(' ')
REFRESH SECURITY TYPE(CONNAUTH)

* --- Server-Connection Channel (Open Access) ---
DEFINE CHANNEL('ADMIN.SVRCONN') CHLTYPE(SVRCONN) TRPTYPE(TCP) MCAUSER('mqm') REPLACE

* --- Test Queues ---
DEFINE QLOCAL('TEST.1') DEFPSIST(YES) REPLACE
DEFINE QLOCAL('TEST.2') DEFPSIST(YES) REPLACE
